.nh
.TH toolbox-help 1
.SH "نام (NAME)"
toolbox-help \- Display help information about Toolbx

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBtoolbox help\fP [\fICOMMAND\fP]

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
When no COMMAND is specified, the \fBtoolbox(1)\fR manual is shown. If a COMMAND
is specified, a manual page for that command is brought up.

.PP
Note that \fBtoolbox --help ...\fR is identical to \fBtoolbox help ...\fR because the
former is internally converted to the latter.

.PP
This page can be displayed with \fBtoolbox help help\fR or \fBtoolbox help --help\fR\&.

.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.SS Show the toolbox manual
.EX
$ toolbox help
.EE

.SS Show the manual for the create command
.EX
$ toolbox help create
.EE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBtoolbox(1)\fR
